# Two source files the site does not load, both over GitHub's 100MB hard
# per-file limit, which is what would have made the first `git push` fail:
#  - the Corita GIF: the page plays /videos/... .mp4, not this 306MB .gif
#  - the smoothed sprite sheet: the head renders the "staggered" variant,
#    and even the smooth path loads a -verified.webp, not this 183MB .png
# Both left on disk untouched; they are just not part of the repo.
/public/assets/corita-art-center/Corita Kent Evergreen Gif.gif
/public/images/rotating-head/sprite-sheet-light-smoothed.png
